SUMMARY:Mother’s Day Brunch at Zenith Vineyard
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Mother’s Day with an unforgettable brunch overlooking the vineyards at Zenith. \nGuests who are 21 years and older will be welcomed with a complimentary glass of Sparkling Brut Rosé—because Mom deserves to be celebrated in style. \nTwo Seatings\n 10:00 AM & 1:00 PM \nPricing \n\n\nAdults: $60 \n\n\nChildren (ages 3–12): $20 \n\n\nChildren under 3: Free \n\n\nPricing is all-inclusive of service. \nKids under three are free\, please add a ticket for our planning purposes.  \nFor our younger guests at this brunch\, a fun coloring table will keep kids entertained while the adults relax and enjoy. Weather permitting\, lawn games will be available for guests of all ages to enjoy!
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/mothers-day-brunch-at-zenith-vineyard/
LOCATION:Zenith Vineyard\, 5657 Zena Road Northwest\, Salem\, Oregon
CATEGORIES:Mother's Day
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/Brunch.png
END:VEVENT
