SUMMARY:St. Johns Bizarre & Parade
DESCRIPTION:The St. Johns Bizarre is a uniquely crafted FREE celebration that kicks off the summer street fair season in Portland. \nHeld annually on the second Saturday in May\, the Bizarre brings music\, crafts\, and food to the crowds who traditionally attended the St. Johns Parade — along with the crowds who also now come for the Bizarre itself. \nAfter the parade\, a portion of the business district in the St. Johns is closed to traffic\, and thousands of people fill our streets to sample dozens of juried craft vendors (a record 200+ last year)\, two stages for music\, great food\, a beer garden serving local libations\, and tons of games and activities. It’s an amazing community event with something for everyone. \nThe 61st Annual St Johns Parade will take place May 9\, 2026 at 12 p.m.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/st-johns-bizarre-parade/
LOCATION:Historic Downtown St. Johns
CATEGORIES:Active,Family Fun,Festival,Kids Calendar,Music,Outdoor,Parade
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/st-johns-bizarre.jpg
END:VEVENT
