SUMMARY:William Temple House Jam!
DESCRIPTION:William Temple House Jam! is a 1-day music event featuring 5 local talents in the garden of the historic Mackenzie Building in NW Portland on May 9th\, 2026\, from 2pm to 8pm. In honor of Mental Health Awareness Month\, William Temple House Jam! will be an inclusive\, all-ages community benefit concert where 100% of proceeds will fund William Temple House’s low-cost counseling and social services. \nYour admission ticket gets you in the door for all five musical performances\, DJ sets\, the exclusive William Temple House Thrift Store pop-up\, and the dance floor. We’ll have local food and drinks\, raffle tickets\, and more available for purchase throughout the day\, with proceeds supporting our counseling & social services. Come for the music\, stay for the community\, and help us make mental health support accessible to all. \n📍 William Temple House | 2023 NW Hoyt St \n📅 Saturday\, May 9 | 2–8 PM \n💛 100% of proceeds benefit William Temple House \n🎟️ Tickets $7–$15 — On sale NOW \n🎤 The line-up: \nFrecks \nNed and Wendy the Band \nAslin \nJeremy Famà \nEmma Sameth \n🎧 DJ sets • 🛍 Thrift Store pop‑up • 🍴 Food + drinks \n🎟 3 raffle packages (one just for the moms 💐) including a special merch package from Portugal. The Man. Raffle tickets on sale now.  \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/william-temple-house-jam/
LOCATION:William Temple House\, 2023 NW Hoyt St\, Portland\, OR\, 97209\, United States
CATEGORIES:Inclusive,Kids Calendar,Mother's Day,Music,Outdoor
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/WTH-Jam-Main-Event-Flyer.png
ORGANIZER;CN="William Temple House":MAILTO:development@williamtemple.org
END:VEVENT
