SUMMARY:Kid's Co. Presents: Camp Granada at The Judy
DESCRIPTION:The cast of Kid’s Co. have arrived at Camp Granada Summer Camp\, and excitement is building for the biggest event of the summer: the Camp Granada Talent Show. As the big night approaches\, the campers audition\, rehearse\, and create plenty of lovable chaos along the way. Enjoy an evening filled with humor\, heart\, and the incredible talents of these young performers as they prepare for their moment in the spotlight. \nThese two performances of Camp Granada will bookend Kid’s Co.’s spring tour\, which brings the show to retirement communities and other venues throughout the Portland area. \nPay-What-You-Will\, $10.00 minimum
