SUMMARY:Mother's Day Cruise on the Portland Spirit
DESCRIPTION:Sweep mom off her feet this Mother’s Day with a special brunch cruise. The whole family will enjoy a two-hour cruise on the Willamette River\, a delicious Northwest brunch buffet\, mimosas or sparkling cider\, live piano music and beautiful river views. Make memories that mom will treasure forever! \n\nSchedule\n\nSunday\, May 10\, 2026 \nMorning Brunch\nBoarding: 9:30 am\nCruising: 10:00 am – 12:00 pm \nAfternoon Brunch\nBoarding: 2:00 pm\nCruising: 2:30 pm – 4:30 pm \n*There is also a dinner cruise available on May 10th. \n\nAdult\n$124.00 \nYouth (1 – 12)\n$62.00 \nInfant (0 – 1)\n$10.00 \nAbout This Experience\n\n\nDuration: 2 hours\nBrunch buffet: View menu\nVegan & GF by request\nSuggested dress: dressy to upscale casual\nWheelchair accessible: See details\nNon-smoking vessel\n\n\nWhat’s Included\n\n\n2-hour cruise on the Willamette River with views of the Historic Milwaukie Waterfront and downtown Portland\nFreshly prepared Northwest brunch buffet\nMimosas\, house sparkling wine & sparkling cider\nCoffee and tea\nAssorted miniature desserts\nReserved table\nLive piano music\nService charge (gratuity)\n\n\nOther beverages like beer\, wine and cocktails (but they are available for purchase on board!)\nSouvenir boarding photo\n\n 
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/mothers-day-cruise-on-the-portland-spirit/
LOCATION:Portland Spirit\, 1010 SW Naito Parkway\, Portland\, 97204\, United States
CATEGORIES:Mother's Day
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/mothers-day-cruise-with-portland-spirit-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
